{"availability":"available","full":"MeowLove/SearchAIO","name":"SearchAIO","description":"A powerful, all-in-one search portal that integrates major search engines and AI chats. Use it as your daily search hub, or generate a \"tutorial\" link to teach others how to search. Features i18n, dark mode, and a fully responsive design. 一个强大的多合一搜索门户，集成了主流搜索引擎和AI聊天。既可作为您的日常搜索中心，也可生成“教学”链接来教别人如何搜索。支持国际化、夜间模式和完全响应式设计。","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":9,"forks":1,"created":"2025-07-09T14:43:24Z","updated":"2026-08-16T09:48:45Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.cxthhhhh.com/","topics":[],"demo":"https://www.cxthhhhh.com/CXT-Lib/SearchAIO/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:22.528Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:22.528Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:22.528Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T01:04:22.528Z","stars":9,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SearchAIO is a powerful, all-in-one search portal that evolves from a fun \"Let Me Search For You\" tool into a versatile daily search hub. It seamlessly integrates major traditional search engines and cutting-edge AI chats, offering two distinct functionalities in one sleek interface."],"features":["Extensive Engine Support: Integrates with Google, Bing, Baidu, Yandex, DuckDuckGo, ChatGPT, Copilot, Perplexity, and more.","Internationalization (i18n): Supports English, Chinese, Russian, Spanish, French, Arabic, Brazilian Portuguese, Japanese, and German; the selected language is saved locally.","Dark/Light Mode: Offers a beautiful, theme-switchable interface that automatically adapts to your system's preference and can be toggled manually.","Fully Responsive: Provides a seamless experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.","Zero Runtime Dependencies: Built with vanilla HTML, CSS, and ES Modules. No framework or build step is required for deployment."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MeowL